Lab 12: Create Automation Controller Users and Teams
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Create and configure teams in Ansible Automation Controller for organizational management
Add users to teams and assign appropriate permissions
Configure role-based access control (RBAC) for team members
Verify team functionality and access permissions
Understand best practices for user and team management in enterprise automation environments
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, students should have:

Basic understanding of Linux command line operations
Familiarity with Ansible concepts and terminology
Knowledge of user management principles
Understanding of role-based access control concepts
Completion of previous Ansible Automation Controller labs (Labs 1-11)
Administrative access to an Ansible Automation Controller instance
